		<p>
			I’m open to research collaborations, healthcare-AI internships, and conversations about rare
			disease diagnostics and access. Reach me on
			<a class="cactus-link" href="https://linkedin.com/in/manveer-singh-tib" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
				>LinkedIn</a
			> or by email. Links are on the home page.
		</p>
	</div>
